Chain Response[Book Venue, Send Invitations] | | |
Chain Response[Send Invitations, Arrange Catering] | | |
Chain Response[Arrange Catering, Hire Staff] | | |
Chain Response[Hire Staff, Set Up Venue] | | |
Chain Response[Set Up Venue, Conduct Rehearsal] | | |
Chain Response[Conduct Rehearsal, Welcome Guests] | | |
Chain Response[Welcome Guests, Facilitate Activities] | | |
Chain Response[Facilitate Activities, Deliver Speech] | | |
Chain Response[Deliver Speech, Serve Meals] | | |
